Cell["\<\
Here we discuss in detail how the function Compute works, illustrated on the \
CCLP black hole in Boyer-Lindquist coordinates.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1944,ExpressionUUID->"22334619-a4d7-46be-9a2c-8df61ac6dbdb"],

