Cell[TextData[StyleBox["The full output (4116 leaves) is deliberately \
abbreviated on this page: \[LeftSkeleton]n\[RightSkeleton] counts omitted \
pieces; evaluating the inputs regenerates it in full.",
 FontSlant->"Italic",
 FontColor->GrayLevel[0.5]]], "ExampleText",
 CellID->1984,ExpressionUUID->"96cc1636-7cef-4a60-babc-1a71b81d7211"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The entire compute instruction set and the result has been stored in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["sol", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "76b8c4a6-ce7f-4a0e-9b56-371bcccd4a88"],
 ". Upon ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["SaveData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/SaveData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "d6069e7a-bedc-4cf0-8a9e-d67286761f0a"],
 " and later ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["GetData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/GetData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "c66c79ae-0d4b-4ef1-8a7c-f392556d9e85"],
 " together with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Load"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/Load", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "f5198c91-00d0-4a7b-804a-92ff02daef61"],
 " the ",
 ButtonBox["TensorValues",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  Appearance->None,
  Evaluator->Automatic,
  ButtonFunction:>NotebookOpen[
    FindFile["xAct/Documentation/English/" <> "xCobaDoc.nb"]]],
 " are hooked to the newly loaded metric gg, such that no re-computing is \
needed."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1985,ExpressionUUID->"fbfd2783-b175-4174-b5a1-917973fa761c"],

Cell["Why two runs?", "Section",
 CellID->1986,ExpressionUUID->"64bf4480-a70c-41bf-b0a1-c52b2e1634fb"],

Cell["\<\
Why do we need two runs: first a sequential run and then a parallel run?\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1987,ExpressionUUID->"06f8fc38-3936-4f62-9a24-f862e60db060"],

Cell["\<\
Neither of them implements the tensor symmetries: that happens before either \
runs, and without evaluating a single component. Compute reads the tensor\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s symmetry group, works out which components are \
independent, which are dependent on them and with what sign, and which vanish \
identically \[LongDash] and then computes only the independent ones. In the \
present case the metric is symmetric, and these are the dependencies it \
recorded:\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellID->1988,ExpressionUUID->"331bcf5f-504b-456e-9f30-b733efdc9db6"],

